1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,280
Shizuoka Regional Tournament finals.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,230
Opponent is the famous Shimizu FC.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:12,320
From the moment the match started, Tsubasa was marked and couldn't move freely.

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,660
The opponent crashing into Wakabayashi to stop him...

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,740
...made things even worse.

6
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:22,080
With the pain in his leg flaring up again, Wakabayashi couldn't move freely.

7
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:28,080
However, with the will to protect the goal, Wakabayashi delivered the ball to Tsubasa.

8
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:31,920
By passing three markers, he managed to score.

9
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:36,130
Nankatsu FC won the Shizuoka Regional Tournament and...

10
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:40,510
...secured their ticket to the national tournament.

11
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,680
Hey Tsubasa! Stop snacking!

12
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:44,630
That hurt.

13
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:49,100
Breakfast will be ready soon, go take a shower.

14
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,900
But I'm starving.

15
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,020
Can't you hurry a bit?

16
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,160
Don't talk back to me.

17
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,400
An ordinary morning at the Ozora house.

18
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,680
The Captain, his mother, Tsubasa...

19
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:02,450
The Ozora family is quite happy right now.

20
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:05,930
But even if the three of them want it...

21
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:08,960
...will it be right for Tsubasa to come with me to Brazil?

22
00:01:09,390 --> 00:01:11,770
A family should be together.

23
00:01:11,770 --> 00:01:15,960
Will I be disrupting this family's happiness?

24
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,590
Roberto!

25
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,840
What's wrong?

26
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:22,120
Nothing.

27
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,600
Alright then.

