52
00:02:57,070 --> 00:03:00,240
Episode 13
And the Nationals

53
00:02:57,070 --> 00:03:00,240
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

54
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:03,030
6th National Youth Football Tournament
Hokkaido Tournament Final

55
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:06,720
Sapporo FC, what are you doing?!

56
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,040
Get the ball back quickly!

57
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:10,040
Only one minute left!

58
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:11,600
Captain!

59
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:15,640
Sapporo FC can't get the ball back despite so many players gathering!

60
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:18,340
Furano's Captain Matsuyama-kun is protecting the ball wonderfully.

61
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,050
I'll never allow it!

62
00:03:21,050 --> 00:03:21,760
Damn it!

63
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,760
He's so stubborn! Let's get it back quickly!

64
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,120
Captain, pass!

65
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:32,810
Impossible. He's completely surrounded. He can't pass.

66
00:03:32,810 --> 00:03:36,310
Matsuyama-kun still manages to keep the ball in a tight space.

67
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:38,820
Will he be able to keep the ball from his opponents?

68
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:41,490
We have entered extra time!

69
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:45,450
Will the regional tournament favorite Sapporo FC lose?

70
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:48,620
Furano! Hold on a little more!

71
00:03:49,010 --> 00:03:51,190
Captain, do your best!

72
00:03:55,170 --> 00:03:57,840
There, the referee blows the whistle.

73
00:03:58,250 --> 00:04:01,310
We did it!

74
00:04:01,310 --> 00:04:03,000
An unexpected result!

75
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:06,300
The favorite, Sapporo FC, lost!

76
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:11,240
Furano Elementary will participate in the nationals they've long dreamed of for the first time!

77
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,060
Including Captain Matsuyama-kun...

78
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:16,630
...each of the 11 players put in a huge effort.

79
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:20,190
Furano Elementary Football Club achieved this result through hard work!

80
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:24,340
We filled the gap Misaki left well.

81
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:25,540
Yes.

82
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:28,180
We'll face him at the nationals.

83
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:29,200
Yes.

84
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:32,080
Misaki, we won.

85
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:35,040
I will play against you at the nationals.

86
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:48,760
You've finished the painting, Dad.

87
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,600
Will we go to another city again?

88
00:04:51,130 --> 00:04:52,220
Yes.

89
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:56,110
After your nationals are over...

90
00:04:56,110 --> 00:04:58,770
...you'll go to another school for the second term.

91
00:04:58,770 --> 00:05:01,240
Let your friends know too.

92
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,530
Okay.

93
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:12,390
Ultimately, it's best for you to give up participating in the nationals.

94
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:13,210
No!

95
00:05:13,210 --> 00:05:14,500
Calm down, Genzo.

96
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:17,440
You're still developing.

97
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,730
You shouldn't push yourself.

98
00:05:18,730 --> 00:05:22,910
It's very obvious that your leg will get worse if you play in the match.

99
00:05:22,910 --> 00:05:26,230
You need to bear with it until it's completely healed.

100
00:05:26,230 --> 00:05:27,620
He's right, Genzo.

101
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:31,010
There will be other opportunities. Give up for this time.

102
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:36,770
But there is someone I want to repay no matter what.

103
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:41,610
Unfortunately, the young master isn't home.

104
00:05:41,610 --> 00:05:44,200
We came in vain, the Captain isn't home.

105
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:47,190
So does this mean the Captain's leg is fine?

106
00:05:47,190 --> 00:05:48,570
I hope so.

107
00:05:48,570 --> 00:05:53,310
Let's hope he heals quickly so we can go play at the nationals together.

108
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:56,180
Then we'll bring the championship home once again.

109
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:57,460
Yes!

110
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,330
Come on, Ryo!

111
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:00,290
Clean the floors properly.

112
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:02,710
You're so nagging!

113
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:06,170
I don't work here!

114
00:06:06,170 --> 00:06:08,560
Look at the cheek on him.

115
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:12,890
Even though the team won, they didn't put you in the match even once.

116
00:06:12,890 --> 00:06:14,890
What can I do?!

117
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:17,530
Everyone on the team is really good.

118
00:06:17,530 --> 00:06:19,980
That's why you should clean the tiles properly.

119
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:21,840
It exercises your legs.

120
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,570
I thought I could rest for a day too.

121
00:06:28,330 --> 00:06:34,660
Thus, the Nankatsu eleven spent their time resting before the nationals.

122
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:36,990
As for Tsubasa...

123
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:49,050
What's wrong, Tsubasa?!

124
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:51,700
Can't you even take a ball like this?

125
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:53,220
O-Okay.

126
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:58,070
What was up with Roberto today?

127
00:06:58,070 --> 00:07:00,350
He was different from usual.

128
00:07:02,890 --> 00:07:06,240
Tsubasa, do you want to go to Brazil no matter what?

129
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:09,190
Yes. Why are you bringing this up suddenly?

130
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:14,250
If you go to Brazil, your mother will be left alone.

131
00:07:14,250 --> 00:07:16,880
Do you still want to come to Brazil with me?

132
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,910
What?

133
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:21,870
Roberto, of course I want to go to Brazil.

134
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:25,380
It's been on my mind for a while.

135
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:30,630
Maybe I'm just forcing you to live my dream.

136
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:33,720
This could break up your family.

137
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:36,370
Roberto, but I--

138
00:07:36,370 --> 00:07:38,180
Tsubasa, I--

139
00:07:40,110 --> 00:07:41,730
Wakabayashi-kun!

140
00:07:41,730 --> 00:07:44,350
Tsubasa, we need to talk.

141
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:49,860
I won't be able to go to the nationals.

142
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,860
What?

143
00:07:52,050 --> 00:07:55,960
It seems my injury is worse than I thought.

144
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,900
I need to wait until it heals.

145
00:07:58,780 --> 00:08:02,250
So I'm going to ask you a favor, Tsubasa.

146
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:07,220
Even if I'm not there, I want you to win no matter what until you face Hyuga Kojiro from Meiwa FC...

147
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:09,580
...no matter what it takes.

148
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:10,920
Wakabayashi-kun...

149
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:16,230
I have to make him pay for the goal he scored on me no matter what.

150
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:19,380
I must be completely healed by the Meiwa match.

151
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:22,560
So I'm begging you, Tsubasa!

152
00:08:23,370 --> 00:08:26,400
I understand. I'll definitely win until then.

153
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,190
Come on, come on!

154
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:35,650
Over here!

155
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,500
What's wrong, kids?! Perk up!

156
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,470
If this heat is already getting you down...

157
00:08:42,470 --> 00:08:45,000
...you'll never win at the nationals!

158
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:45,620
Okay!

159
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:52,210
Do you think Wakabayashi's absence is harming the kids' motivation?

160
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:53,180
Yes.

161
00:08:53,180 --> 00:08:59,760
The impact of Wakabayashi's absence on team cohesion is greater than its effect on us.

162
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:03,320
Moreover, Wakabayashi, the backbone of our defense...

163
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,770
...held the entire team together as Captain.

164
00:09:05,770 --> 00:09:12,440
Game aside, knowing he won't be with them when going to Tokyo also dampens the eleven's morale.

165
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:16,260
But despite everything, the one whose morale is always high is Tsubasa.

166
00:09:16,260 --> 00:09:17,280
Misaki-kun!

167
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,960
Here! One, two!

168
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,960
And Misaki is always by his side.

169
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:25,540
I did it!

170
00:09:25,540 --> 00:09:28,650
Idiot! Can't you even stop this?

171
00:09:28,650 --> 00:09:32,750
We'll be counting on you while Wakabayashi is gone!

172
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:32,750
And there's Ishizaki, of course.

173
00:09:35,630 --> 00:09:40,140
I promised Wakabayashi-kun that I would win.

174
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:47,230
Mama-san.

175
00:09:47,230 --> 00:09:51,230
If Tsubasa leaves, won't you feel lonely all alone?

176
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:54,100
What? Where did that come from all of a sudden?

177
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:55,820
Please answer, Mama-san.

178
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:02,320
I'd be lying if I said I wouldn't feel lonely, but...

179
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:07,590
...as my husband says, families shouldn't interfere with their children's dreams.

180
00:10:07,590 --> 00:10:10,330
But Tsubasa is still in elementary school.

181
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:15,060
But Tsubasa is very mature for his age.

182
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:18,840
Being a first-class football player...

183
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:21,340
...is also Tsubasa's dream.

184
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:27,020
So him going with you by his side makes me happy deep down.

185
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:30,360
The fact that he's doing everything for his dream right now...

186
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:36,190
...and moving forward without looking back makes me happy.

187
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:39,450
Everyone, well done on your efforts.

188
00:10:39,450 --> 00:10:44,370
In three days, we'll set off for Tokyo to participate in the nationals.

189
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:47,700
Therefore, we will now elect a new captain.

190
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:48,890
A new captain?

191
00:10:48,890 --> 00:10:50,040
What happened to Wakabayashi?

192
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:54,090
Unfortunately, his injury has worsened and he won't be able to participate.

193
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:58,840
So we need someone to fill Wakabayashi's void.

194
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,590
It's obvious that Wakabayashi's absence is difficult.

195
00:11:01,590 --> 00:11:06,930
But if we dwell on it, we'll never make progress.

196
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,850
So I'll announce it.

197
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,480
The new captain of Nankatsu FC...

198
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:17,300
...is Ozora Tsubasa!

199
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:19,240
M-Me?

200
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,900
You're the man, Tsubasa!

201
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:22,290
Tsubasa, huh.

202
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:24,490
We've become a very cheerful team.

203
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:27,490
From today, with the new Captain Tsubasa...

204
00:11:27,490 --> 00:11:30,350
...we'll show how the new Nankatsu FC plays football.

205
00:11:30,350 --> 00:11:31,600
Okay!

206
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,990
Tsubasa, as the new Captain, greet the team.

207
00:11:33,990 --> 00:11:34,500
Okay!

208
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:41,970
Let's all become the best in Japan together!

209
00:11:41,970 --> 00:11:43,700
Yes!

210
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:52,250
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

211
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:56,310
Mom. They made me captain.

212
00:11:56,310 --> 00:11:58,310
What? You?

213
00:11:58,310 --> 00:12:01,030
Yes. I need to tell Roberto too.

214
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:02,110
Where is he?

215
00:12:02,110 --> 00:12:04,370
I think he just went out.

216
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:06,870
What? Oh well.

217
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:11,750
But if you're going to be captain, you'll have to work even harder.

218
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:13,000
Yes.

219
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:25,510
Why am I so hesitant when there's no problem for anyone?

220
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:29,510
Wasn't I the one who wanted to take Tsubasa to Brazil?

221
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:32,770
Then why?!

222
00:12:35,770 --> 00:12:39,520
The time for the nationals has come, Tsubasa.

223
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,140
Do your best.

224
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:44,570
And I'm counting on you for everything, Roberto.

225
00:12:47,610 --> 00:12:55,460
Finally, today Nankatsu FC will depart for Tokyo to participate in the nationals.

226
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:59,360
So, for the purpose of wishing Nankatsu FC victory...

227
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:03,010
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

228
00:13:03,010 --> 00:13:05,140
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

229
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:07,510
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

230
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:09,510
What a big send-off.

231
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:11,460
It's practically turned into a spectacle.

232
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:13,770
Your mom is incredible, too.

233
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:16,010
#Push Ishizaki Ryo#

234
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:16,010
Ryo! Show them your days!

235
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:19,040
Wakabayashi-san didn't even come to see us off.

236
00:13:19,890 --> 00:13:22,190
He probably couldn't bear to watch us leave.

237
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:25,940
I will definitely keep my promise, Wakabayashi-kun.

238
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:27,070
Tsubasa!

239
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:30,850
Roberto! Watch my matches!

240
00:13:30,850 --> 00:13:33,770
I will definitely go to Brazil.

241
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:40,840
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

242
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:47,220
Tsubasa-kun! We'll follow you from behind!

243
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:54,560
I'm counting on you, everyone.

244
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,940
I'll be there too.

245
00:13:58,980 --> 00:14:00,940
— Tokyo —

246
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:03,940
— Wangan Football Stadium —

247
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:10,070
We've finally arrived at the nationals!

248
00:14:10,070 --> 00:14:11,870
As cheerful as ever.

249
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:14,610
Is everyone here?

250
00:14:14,610 --> 00:14:17,250
Double-check that you haven't forgotten anything.

251
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:19,480
Shall we go check out the field?

252
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:22,240
Let's drop off the bags at the hotel first.

253
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,920
Hey you! What are you doing?!

254
00:14:27,010 --> 00:14:28,130
What?!

255
00:14:28,130 --> 00:14:29,630
Take it, Kazuo!

256
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,510
Nice pass!

257
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,150
What?

258
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:34,650
What are they doing?

259
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:38,180
They're passing from opposite sides of the platform.

260
00:14:38,850 --> 00:14:42,480
Hey! Cut it out!

261
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,320
Tokyo station attendants are such nags.

262
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:48,780
Masao!

263
